From eda6e3a0cbeb76d474a52b0e32807548ac15b541 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:54:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 56/61] Berry stand at the Celadon Department Store

A third clerk at the 2F counter sells berries, since FireRed can't grow
them: status berries, Oran and Leppa from the start; Sitrus, Lum and the
confusion berries after Erika; pinch berries, Lansat, Starf and the
EV-lowering berries after the Champion. Berry prices raised from 20.
The spoiler guide labels badge-gated shop lists. tools/hack/berry_shop.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
